## Summary

This PR adds the configuration required to deploy a new Ignition SIM instance to the DEV and QA environments.

The new instance reuses the existing deployment configuration while introducing a separate set of license and client secret values as required.

## Changes

- Added a new overlay for the Ignition SIM instance.
- Updated Kustomize configuration for the new instance.
- Added/updated SecretProviderClass configuration for the new license secrets.
- Configured the new Ignition license key and activation token.
- Updated application labels/names where required to support the new instance.
- Kept all other deployment configuration consistent with the existing Ignition SIM deployment.

## Files Changed

- Added new Kustomize overlay for the new Ignition SIM instance.
- Updated `kustomization.yaml`.
- Updated `secret-provider-class-license.yaml`.
- Updated deployment configuration (if applicable).
- Updated any environment-specific configuration required for DEV and QA.

## Validation

- Verified Kustomize build completes successfully.
- Verified manifests are generated without errors.
- Confirmed the new instance references the correct license and activation secrets.
- Confirmed existing Ignition SIM configuration remains unchanged.

## Notes

- No functional changes to the existing Ignition SIM instance.
- This PR only introduces configuration for the additional Ignition SIM instance.
